    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "well my neighbor had something similar last year and he just took some extra salt and magnesium and he was fine. he didn't end up needing the hospital at all. i have some of those supplements here and some gatorade. if i just take a little more magnesium and keep my fluids up, can't i just monitor myself for a few days to see if it happens again? it seems really extreme to go to the hospital just for a few seconds of dizziness.",
